  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Chili Fudge.png|200px|left|Chili Fudge|link=Special:FilePath/Chili Fudge.png]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 104\n |price = 1 to 540\n |time = 2 h 50 m\n |source = {{Infoicon|fudges|bigger|link=Fudge Shop}}\n |xp = 64\n |base = 150\n |dia = 6\n |time3 = 2 h 24 min\n}}\n'''Chili Fudge''' is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 104.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making chili fudge'''===\n[[File:Fudge Shop.png|150px|left|Fudge Shop|link=Special:FilePath/Fudge_Shop.png]]\nChili Fudge is made in the [[Fudge Shop]].\n\nTo make the chili fudge, players need the following ingredient, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Butter.png|75px|Butter|link=Butter]]\n|[[File:Cacao.png|75px|Cacao|link=Cacao]]\n|[[File:White Sugar.png|75px|White sugar|link=White Sugar]]\n|[[File:Chili Pepper.png|75px|Chili Pepper|link=Chili Pepper]]\n|-\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x3'''\n|}\nIt takes 2 hours 50 minutes to make one serving, and 2 hours and 25 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] shop. Each serving gives players 64 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling chili fudge'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Chili fudge can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 5,400 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 servings.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make the chili fudge costs 494 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 chili fudge per crate, up to a total of 4 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Chilikaramelle\n|es = Fudge de chile\n|fr = Caramel au Chili\n|it = Fudge al peperoncino\n|nl = Chilitoffee\n|no = Chilifudge\n|ru = Ирис с чили\n|zh = Chili Fudge\n}}\n[[pt-br:Trufa apimentada]]\n\n[[Category:Fudge Shop Products]]\n[[Category:Butter Products]]\n[[Category:Cacao Products]]\n[[Category:White Sugar Products]]\n[[Category:Chili Pepper Products]]",
